    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第5题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26福建事考）若一个正方体的棱长增加原来的40%，则其表面积比原正方体的表面积增加（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "40%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "96%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "160%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "196%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          160
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          154
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05-p160.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二） · 实战精刷5 · 讲义第154页",
            "pdfPage": 160
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把新棱长看作原来的1.4倍。两个正方体相似，表面积比等于棱长比的平方，即1.4²=1.96。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "1.96表示新表面积是原来的196%，题目问增加了多少，还要减去原来的100%，得到96%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{\\Delta S}{S}=1.4^2-1=0.96=96\\%"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选B。D把“变为196%”误当成“增加196%”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
