        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "长度增幅先转成倍数再平方，最后减1才是面积增幅。"
        }
      ],
