    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）一个空的倒置的圆锥形容器，倒入1瓶固定容量的水后，水的高度恰好为容器高度的一半。若要使容器盛满水，则需要再倒入水的瓶数为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "5瓶"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "7瓶"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "8瓶"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "10瓶"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          161
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          155
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-06-p161.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第155页",
            "pdfPage": 161
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看“倒置”：圆锥尖端向下，半高的水体本身是一个与整锥相似的小圆锥。高度比1：2，体积比1：8。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "1瓶水只占总容积的1/8，装满总共要8瓶；题目问再倒入几瓶，所以8−1=7瓶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{V_{\\text{水}}}{V_{\\text{总}}}=\\left(\\frac12\\right)^3=\\frac18,\\quad8-1=7"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们选B。水高一半不表示体积一半，也不要把总瓶数8误当成还需要的瓶数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          161
