    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-07-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-07",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "先由相似求注满倒锥的时间，再把剩余时间换成圆柱高度。"
        }
      ],
